sequenceDiagram
    actor Player
    participant Main as Main Loop
    participant Mode as Active Mode
    participant Dispatch as Dispatcher
    participant World as World Command
    participant Type as Object-Type Handler
    participant Lua as Object-Specific Lua
    participant State as Run State
    participant Output

    Player->>Main: Enter command

    alt A mode is active
        Main->>Mode: Handle input
        Mode-->>Main: Response
    else No mode is active
        Main->>Dispatch: Parse and dispatch input

        alt World-level command
            Dispatch->>World: Handle command
            World-->>Dispatch: Response
        else Object-targeted command
            Dispatch->>Type: Handle action on object
            alt Type handles action
                Type-->>Dispatch: Response
            else Type passes
                Dispatch->>Lua: Try custom handler
                Lua-->>Dispatch: Response
            end
        end

        Dispatch-->>Main: Response
    end

    opt Response contains effects
        Main->>State: Validate and apply effects
    end

    opt Response contains text
        Main->>Output: Display text
        Output-->>Player: Show response
    end
